cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite ShootingCSP."
title: "ShootingCSP: Controllable Crystal Structure Prediction with ShootingFlow"
abstract: >-
  ShootingCSP is a Python library for controllable crystal structure
  prediction. Its core algorithm, ShootingFlow, formulates generative
  flow-matching inference and physical constraints as an optimal-control
  shooting problem.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Aobo
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-23
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/aoyang17/ShootingCSP"
keywords:
  - crystal structure prediction
  - generative model
  - flow matching
  - optimal control
  - ShootingFlow
